<title>MEXICO: Mexico's May average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's May average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) updated average crude oil prices for May on Friday.</p>
<p>Below follows a comparative table of prices, by type and region exported.</p>
<p>    Type		   May 97	April 97	May 96</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>    Maya		    15.20	   14.35	 16.36</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 18.23	   17.04	 19.62</p>
<p>    Olmeca		  19.42	   18.37	 20.17</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Maya		    13.02*	  12.95	 14.31</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 17.44*	  16.82	 17.37</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>    Maya		    15.50	   13.94	 15.18</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 19.30	   17.74	 17.83</p>
<p>Note: *prices on exports to Europe are preliminary figures</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
